<title>CHINA: Societe Generale HK branch places HK$50 mln CD.</title>
<headline>Societe Generale HK branch places HK$50 mln CD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Hong Kong branch has privately placed a HK$50 million two-year fixed rate certificate of deposit issue, arranger Societe Generale Asia said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 7.1 percent certificates were issued at par.</p>
<p>The payment date is August 6.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
